{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0083_1000_p", "source_sha256": "3e118b5bde1f90bb290b2fef65874e8c677090911ba7b4e2d69cf1b62f9fd0ed", "ja": "（765プロのアイドルたちが出演する、剣と魔法の\nファンタジードラマ。今は春香が練習中だ）", "zh": "（765艺能的偶像们即将参与拍摄\n剑与魔法的奇幻电视剧，目前春香正在练习。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0083_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5c769d8693d32604b5ef121f0a10da9ce3f4350f99cedbc9ac2636807584f582", "ja": "お疲れ、春香！\n練習の方は順調か？", "zh": "春香，辛苦了！\n练习还顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0083_1002_001har", "source_sha256": "20423c78e71fd1938e0b1684be427a431a905031e06d7c7ff2441f2db8ad38ff", "ja": "あっ、お疲れさまです、{$P$}さん！\nそうなんです、聞いてください！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生，你辛苦了！\n非常顺利喔，请听我说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0083_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "2f8f27505f0d337738c7adc26ff5bf27c69827d0f3039ffb3d7cdd478adc3e80", "ja": "実はさっき、演技指導の先生に、\n上手になったねって、ほめられたんです！", "zh": "刚刚呀，指导演技的老师\n夸说有进步了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0083_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ac092ff353ac283be02a8079fda1ce25290367f7f662c6082f691853fad8ed95", "ja": "おっ、すごいじゃないか。\nさすがだな、春香！", "zh": "喔，很厉害嘛！\n真不愧是春香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0083_1005_001har", "source_sha256": "032fdb52edd8787656e9532f80bbb89ca9c48f6457b0a48f6a0e8b52850798eb", "ja": "あ、いえ、ほめられたのは私じゃなくて。\n一緒に練習してた未来ちゃんですよ♪", "zh": "啊，被夸奖的不是我，\n是跟我一起练习的未来♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0083_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4d1bb1a85b97c15ffeccbca930d93ef7ca4a2df4eefda0ae1e8ebbf6f831a52b", "ja": "へえ、そうだったのか。そういえば春香は……\nたしか未来の先輩、みたいな役だっけ？", "zh": "哦，是这样啊。说起来，春香……\n我记得你的角色好像是未来的前辈？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0083_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "7468fc114a40b095017b00627feba9cd831aa6a198f2ca85cca2593aeba19bdd", "ja": "はい、勇者の未来ちゃんを導く、先代勇者！です♪\nだから未来ちゃんとは一緒のシーンが多くて。", "zh": "嗯，我是引导勇者未来的前任勇者♪\n所以有不少和未来一起演出的场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0083_1008_001har", "source_sha256": "a62b11f2044ee128cf83560811d91866c57de5910c64c78f568e6378eb6da5f4", "ja": "練習もよく一緒でしたから、わかるんですけど……\n未来ちゃん、すごく頑張ってたんですっ。", "zh": "毕竟常常一起练习，所以我也知道……\n未来她真的非常努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0083_1009_p", "source_sha256": "08732a18dcf4886360a7a83a8896bf736cc10a518ea436c62807f345ad770420", "ja": "うん、なにしろ勇者だからな……。\n注目が集まる役だし、覚えることも多いはずだ。", "zh": "嗯，她可是勇者嘛……\n是万众瞩目的角色，要学的应该也很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0083_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "642d859e3e676412e6ee929d9d39bfeabd0716e2d930152619afe68919134c07", "ja": "そうなんです。それで、ちゃんと頑張ってた未来ちゃん\nがほめてもらえて、私も、すっごく嬉しくて……♪", "zh": "对呀，所以听到未来的努力受到肯定时，\n我真的觉得好开心……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0083_1011_p", "source_sha256": "1c3659e1f95111b8d43e30e535d1c24b46a81601b2b1a1f8556aaaeda5a20d3a", "ja": "そうか……。きっとレッスンでも、\n春香が勇者の後輩を導いてくれたんだな。", "zh": "这样啊……我想这肯定也是在练习的时候，\n春香引导了后进的勇者吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0083_1012_001har", "source_sha256": "cbc866ef05206d15f1eb0537dacb2710418e78c59feed51162e9325c2a92beae", "ja": "えっ。……ええっ！？\nそ、そんな、導いたなんてとんでもないです！", "zh": "咦……咦咦！？\n别、别这么说，我才没厉害到能引导人呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0083_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "60ab24d6c46680f135d6fefe0f9e549010ea59bab52c46f9f717dd39b810bfe3", "ja": "もちろん、たまには、アドバイスみたいなことも\n言ったりして……ましたけど……たまにです、すごく！", "zh": "我是偶尔会说一些类似建议的话没错……\n可是……真的很偶尔、非常偶尔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0083_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ecdb208c367c6ade9778f7b297a8ae25489720056f660d1b13bd75edf95f3687", "ja": "はは、そういうのが大事なんだよ。誰かが見てくれて\nるって思うだけで、励みになるだろうし。", "zh": "哈哈，这种小地方才重要。光是感觉到自己的努力\n有人看在眼里，就已经是一种鼓励了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0083_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "f42aef17fd4976e473383f17c67931413c0fa6e172e39a6e5d58ac7dd3292ade", "ja": "そ、そうなんでしょうか……。あ、もちろん、\n役に立てたのなら、嬉しいんですけど……。", "zh": "是、是这样吗……？\n啊，如果我有帮上忙，那当然是很开心没错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0083_1016_001har", "source_sha256": "3ae01ae71270d28a0d28c60083f2c5eb0a53a456b80bb50d4c589cd68aac822c", "ja": "あっ。でも……そうですね！\nたしかに私、少しは役に立てたのかも！", "zh": "啊，可是……说得也是！\n我应该有帮上一点忙才对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0083_1017_p", "source_sha256": "e104303d6297d5e8bbc5a7f2d4b7cca5332f8746b4544eac0632e5d684ac67e9", "ja": "ん？　どうしたんだ急に？", "zh": "嗯？你怎么突然这么说？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0083_1018_001har", "source_sha256": "e827c50b6a3d0c5d10e33e70f997ebf04525b76f2e4da0fe39da965a4720f48d", "ja": "だって、ちゃんとアドバイスをもらえたり、\nいつもそばで見守っててもらえたりするのって……。", "zh": "因为，可以得到别人的建议、\n有人总是在身旁关注自己的表现……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0083_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "de1a019e5fa966e16a9428e9510a0611c560d58faae9546ac0fef8949e0fe6d3", "ja": "本当に、すっごく、励みになりますからっ。\n……ね、{$P$}さん♪　えへへっ！", "zh": "真的会给自己很大的鼓励！\n……对吧，{$P$}先生♪嘿嘿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
